heading: "Guiding the NEDC26 program"
lede: "The Programming Steering Committee was selected through a competitive expression of interest process."
permalink: "/committee/"
---
<section class="section">
  <div class="wrap prose">
    <p>Representing a breadth of expertise from across the sector, the committee helps shape a dynamic and thought provoking program aligned to the 2026 theme, <em>Place to Prosperity: Innovation, Transition and Investment Attraction</em>. Together they guide discussions on how places can drive growth, navigate transition and attract investment to build resilient and prosperous communities.</p>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section section--sunk">
  <div class="wrap stack-l">
    <div>
      <div class="section-head">
        <h2 class="h-l">Committee members</h2>
        <p class="util num" style="color: var(--text-mute)">{{ committee | length }} members</p>
      </div>
      <hr class="rule">
    </div>
    <div class="listing">
      {% for m in committee %}
      <div class="listing__row">
        <p class="listing__name">{{ m.name }}</p>
        <p class="listing__meta">{{ m.role }}</p>
        <span></span>
      </div>
      {% endfor %}
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
